            "source:a9585b8e5d17229001d2262e",
            "source:4794dbff974add659b85e9ed"
          ],
          "text": "Captain Ellis commands the pirate crew of the Sister Mercy, which stole the Aesirites shield from Sorlof. Ellis recruits help against Sorlof and the mutinous gunners, promising a share of the booty. Ellis says the cursed shield has troubled the crew and insists it be taken off the ship. The captain's orders and battle cries are raucous, swaggering pirate talk.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24910
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 24911,
      "name": "Cursed Sea Dog",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24911:identity",
